# 404 catch-all � must be last
# Serves /404.html with a real HTTP 404 status for any unmatched route.
# Cloudflare Pages also auto-serves 404.html natively, but this rule
# makes the 404 status explicit and works for all path patterns.
/*               /404.html                 404
